'''Elementalist [[Istani armor]]''' is an art type available in the Nightfall campaign as starter armor, as [[collector]] armor for the region of [[Istan]] and as regular crafted armor. The collector helm is only available with an [[Energy Storage]] +1 bonus. 

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Istani armor.

